  "info": {
    "title": "Lo-fi",
    "author": "Atomik Rack factory",
    "notes": "A slow, dusty lo-fi loop in A minor at 82 BPM: a crushed drum kit with the kick on its own track, a soft plucked bass that ducks from the kick, warm seventh chords through tape warmth, a mellow tine arpeggio and a radio-dust texture, with a small chamber and a tape echo. The first verse has no melody: play one over the chords. Turn the tape warmth up on the chords, or lengthen the break and let the arpeggio carry it."
  },
